+/* The parser asks an expression for its key path to decide what it is
+ * looking at - whether a.b can be folded into one key path, whether what
+ * precedes "(" names a function.  -keyPath raises for a kind that has
+ * none (a variable, an aggregate, a subquery), so the question is asked
